# Get fit for Life with Muso African Dance Troupe

Join the Muso Foli Dance Troupe for a GET FIT FOR LIFE workshop. Learn traditional West African dance, get fit and have fun. All entry free as part of the Wellness month at the Eumundi Markets. 11am-12pm. No experience necessary. All levels of dance welcome. No bookings necessary. See you there!
